{"id":"a02811a5f1367e7a","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-parametrized-consistency-statement.md","title":"Consistency Sentence for a Chosen Predicate","display":"df-parametrized-consistency-statement — Consistency Sentence for a Chosen Predicate","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-parametrized-consistency-statement","aliases":["92-df-parametrized-consistency-statement"],"display":"df-parametrized-consistency-statement — Consistency Sentence for a Chosen Predicate","source":"第 IX 章 pp. 106–108（PDF 123–125）","source_status":"原书内容的显式重构","depends_on":["[[92-df-arithmetic-system]]","[[92-df-hbl-provability-predicate]]","[[92-df-arithmetic-truth]]","[[92-df-consistent]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-parametrized-consistency-statement"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-parametrized-consistency-statement</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-parametrized-consistency-statement — Consistency Sentence for a Chosen Predicate"},{"key":"source","html":"第 IX 章 pp. 106–108（PDF 123–125）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的显式重构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"62f011418ee9c44e\" href=\"?note=62f011418ee9c44e\" title=\"92-df-arithmetic-system\">92-df-arithmetic-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"466c532d80d46a83\" href=\"?note=466c532d80d46a83\" title=\"92-df-hbl-provability-predicate\">92-df-hbl-provability-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"482ac6c3f68b4b5b\" href=\"?note=482ac6c3f68b4b5b\" title=\"92-df-arithmetic-truth\">92-df-arithmetic-truth</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c7befd96bd551ade\" href=\"?note=c7befd96bd551ade\" title=\"92-df-consistent\">92-df-consistent</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ArithSys}_G(\\mathcal S)\">\\(\\mathrm{ArithSys}_G(\\mathcal S)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\">\\(B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}_G(B)\\subseteq\\{v_0\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}_G(B)\\subseteq\\{v_0\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S\\vdash\\neg f\">\\(\\mathcal S\\vdash\\neg f\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box_BX=\\mathrm{Inst}_G^1(B;\\overline{\\ulcorner X\\urcorner})\">\\(\\Box_BX=\\mathrm{Inst}_G^1(B;\\overline{\\ulcorner X\\urcorner})\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ArithTrue}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{ArithTrue}_G\\)</span> 是标准自然数真值。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CorrectProv}_{\\mathcal S}(B)\">\\(\\mathrm{CorrectProv}_{\\mathcal S}(B)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_{\\mathcal S,B,f}\">\\(C_{\\mathcal S,B,f}\\)</span> 为下文定义的性质与闭句。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}parametrized\\text{-}consistency\\text{-}statement}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{CorrectProv}_{\\mathcal S}(B)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall X\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\n(\\mathrm{ArithTrue}_G(\\Box_BX)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathcal S\\vdash X),\\\\\nC_{\\mathcal S,B,f}&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg\\Box_Bf\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G,\\\\\n\\mathrm{CorrectProv}_{\\mathcal S}(B)&amp;\\Longrightarrow\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{ArithTrue}_G(C_{\\mathcal S,B,f})\n\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathcal S)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}parametrized\\text{-}consistency\\text{-}statement}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{CorrectProv}_{\\mathcal S}(B)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall X\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\n(\\mathrm{ArithTrue}_G(\\Box_BX)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathcal S\\vdash X),\\\\\nC_{\\mathcal S,B,f}&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg\\Box_Bf\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G,\\\\\n\\mathrm{CorrectProv}_{\\mathcal S}(B)&amp;\\Longrightarrow\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{ArithTrue}_G(C_{\\mathcal S,B,f})\n\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathcal S)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>最后一行使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S\\vdash\\neg f\">\\(\\mathcal S\\vdash\\neg f\\)</span>：若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 可证即不相容；若有任意互相否定的闭句都可证，经典爆炸律又给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 可证。</p>\n<p>这是给定呈现、给定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span>、给定可反驳句 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 的一致性句。标准模型正确性与 HBL 的 P1–P3 是不同的契约；前者给出真实一致性的语义解释，后者支持第二不完备性。一个定理集可有多个有效呈现与内部谓词，不能无说明地把它们视为同一条对象语言句子。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 IX 章 pp. 106–108（PDF 123–125）。页码同时给出印刷页与 PDF 页；所有公式均为本地重构。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-arithmetic-system","status":"resolved","id":"62f011418ee9c44e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-arithmetic-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-hbl-provability-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"466c532d80d46a83","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-hbl-provability-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-arithmetic-truth","status":"resolved","id":"482ac6c3f68b4b5b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-arithmetic-truth]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-consistent","status":"resolved","id":"c7befd96bd551ade","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-consistent]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{ArithSys}_G(\\mathcal S)","display":false},{"tex":"B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FV}_G(B)\\subseteq\\{v_0\\}","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal S\\vdash\\neg f","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box_BX=\\mathrm{Inst}_G^1(B;\\overline{\\ulcorner X\\urcorner})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ArithTrue}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CorrectProv}_{\\mathcal S}(B)","display":false},{"tex":"C_{\\mathcal S,B,f}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}parametrized\\text{-}consistency\\text{-}statement}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{CorrectProv}_{\\mathcal S}(B)&\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall X\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\n(\\mathrm{ArithTrue}_G(\\Box_BX)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathcal S\\vdash X),\\\\\nC_{\\mathcal S,B,f}&\\coloneqq\\neg\\Box_Bf\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G,\\\\\n\\mathrm{CorrectProv}_{\\mathcal S}(B)&\\Longrightarrow\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{ArithTrue}_G(C_{\\mathcal S,B,f})\n\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathcal S)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal S\\vdash\\neg f","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false}],"bytes":2142,"backlinks":[{"id":"fceaada2b896f5e2","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Con}_T,\\mathrm{Con}_U\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G$ (arithmetized consistency sentences for the chosen presentations of $T,U$, see [[92-df-parametrized-consistency-statement]])"},{"id":"3ccc8054e82f6b5d","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-96","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"任意所选系统和谓词的一致性句见[[92-df-parametrized-consistency-statement]]。[[92-df-iterated-consistency]]与[[92-thm-consistency-strength-hierarchy]]是附有额外条件的本地扩展。"},{"id":"911d25a82b6a7593","anchor":"ref-106","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-parametrized-consistency-statement]]"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-121","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-parametrized-consistency-statement]]"}],"outgoing":["62f011418ee9c44e","466c532d80d46a83","482ac6c3f68b4b5b","c7befd96bd551ade"]}